Patch intent: Add Guix template distribution support

Qubes Builder v2 dispatches template builds by distribution family.  Add
Guix as a rolling VM distribution and allow the template plugin to fetch a
builder-guix component for Guix template content.

The template environment mirrors existing Arch and Gentoo template
builders: TEMPLATE_CONTENT_DIR points at the fetched builder component,
CACHE_DIR is the builder cache, and KEYS_DIR points at the
component-provided keys directory.

This only wires Builder v2 to a future builder-guix component.  It does
not implement Guix rootfs generation inside Builder v2.

Suggested validation:
PYTHONPATH=$PWD python -m pytest -q \
  tests/test_objects.py::test_dist_non_default_arch \
  tests/test_objects.py::test_dist_family \
  tests/test_objects.py::test_template_plugin_supports_guix \
  tests/test_objects.py::test_template_plugin_guix_parameters

